{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2CO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"哥林多後書","commonName":"哥林多後書","title":"哥林多後書","order":47,"numberOfChapters":13,"sha256":"a604231fbbea35edac5846ad421a3341b06e5df55de9ee83d42c78413669680e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":13,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/13.json","totalNumberOfVerses":257},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我們與上帝同工的，也勸你們不可徒受他的恩典。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因為他說：「在悅納的時候，我應允了你；在拯救的日子，我搭救了你。」看哪，現在正是悅納的時候！現在正是拯救的日子；"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我們凡事都不叫人有妨礙，免得這職分被人毀謗；"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["反倒在各樣的事上表明自己是上帝的用人，就如在許多的忍耐、患難、窮乏、困苦、"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["鞭打、監禁、擾亂、勤勞、警醒、不食、"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["廉潔、知識、恆忍、恩慈、聖靈的感化、無偽的愛心、"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["真實的道理、上帝的大能；仁義的兵器在左在右；"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["榮耀、羞辱，惡名、美名；似乎是誘惑人的，卻是誠實的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["似乎不為人所知，卻是人所共知的；似乎要死，卻是活着的；似乎受責罰，卻是不致喪命的；"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["似乎憂愁，卻是常常快樂的；似乎貧窮，卻是叫許多人富足的；似乎一無所有，卻是樣樣都有的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["哥林多人哪，我們向你們，口是張開的，心是寬宏的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["你們狹窄，原不在乎我們，是在乎自己的心腸狹窄。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["你們也要照樣用寬宏的心報答我。我這話正像對自己的孩子說的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["永生上帝的殿"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["你們和不信的原不相配，不要同負一軛。義和不義有甚麼相交呢？光明和黑暗有甚麼相通呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["基督和彼列",{"noteId":6},"有甚麼相和呢？信主的和不信主的有甚麼相干呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["上帝的殿和偶像有甚麼相同呢？因為我們是永生上帝的殿，就如上帝曾說：",{"text":"我要在他們中間居住，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在他們中間來往；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作他們的上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要作我的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又說：你們務要從他們中間出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"與他們分別；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要沾不潔淨的物，我就收納你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要作你們的父；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要作我的兒女。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是全能的主說的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":6,"caller":"-","text":"彼列就是撒但的別名","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/2CO/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}